TERCEROS / THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS

Este repositorio NO redistribuye las DLL de Microsoft Analysis Services
(ADOMD.NET y TOM). Se descargan por separado con `scripts/fetch_libs.py` desde
las fuentes oficiales de Microsoft y quedan bajo `libs/`, que esta excluido del
control de versiones. Su uso se rige por los terminos de licencia de Microsoft
que acompanan a esos paquetes, no por esta licencia MIT.

This repository does NOT redistribute the Microsoft Analysis Services client
libraries (ADOMD.NET and TOM). They are fetched separately by
`scripts/fetch_libs.py` from official Microsoft sources into `libs/`, which is
excluded from version control. Their use is governed by the Microsoft license
terms shipped with those packages, not by this MIT license.
